          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 9.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ariko iherezo, umubare w'Abisirayeli uzangana n'umusenyi wo ku nyanja, utabasha kugerwa habe no kubarika, kandi aho babwirirwaga ngo ‘Ntimuri ubwoko bwanjye’, bazahabwirirwa ngo ‘Muri abana b'Imana ihoraho.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.1-2:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "muri Bibliya Yera ya mbere, iyi mirongo ni 1.10-11; bityo, 2.1-23 ihwanye na 2.3-25 muri iyi Bibliya, nk'uko biri mu Ruheburayo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Abayuda n'Abisirayeli bazateranira hamwe, bitoranyirize umutware umwe, kandi bazazamuka bave mu gihugu, kuko umunsi wa Yezerēli uzaba ukomeye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abisirayeli bahanirwa ubusambanyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ami we, mubwire abo muva inda imwe, nawe Ruhama, mubwire bashiki banyu muti ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Nimuburane na nyoko muburane’, kuko atari umugore wanjye nanjye sindi umugabo we, akure ubumaraya mu maso he, n'ubusambanyi abukure hagati y'amabere ye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kugira ngo ntamwambika ubusa akamera nk'umunsi yavutseho, nkamuhindura nk'ikidaturwa, nkamugira nk'igihugu cyumye kandi nkamwisha inyota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ntabwo nzagirira abana be imbabazi, kuko ari ibibyarwa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyina akaba yarigize maraya. Uwasamye inda yabo yakoze ibiteye isoni kuko yavuze ati: Nzikurikirira abakunzi banjye, abantunga mu byo ndya n'ibyo nywa, kandi bakampa ubwoya bw'intama n'imigwegwe n'amavuta ya elayo n'ibyo kunywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ni cyo gituma ngiye kuzitiza inzira ye amahwa, kandi nkubaka uruzitiro kugira ngo atabona aho anyura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azakurikira abakunzi be ariko ntazabashyikira, azabashaka ababure. Ni bwo azavuga ati ‘Henga nsubire ku mugabo wanjye wa mbere, kuko ibya mbere byandutiye iby'ubu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Erega ntiyamenye ko ari jye wamutungaga mu myaka, na vino, n'amavuta ya elayo, nkamugwiriza izo feza n'izahabu bakoreshereje Bāli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni cyo kizatuma nisubiza imyaka yanjye mu isarura, na vino yanjye mu gihe cyayo, kandi nkamwambura ubwoya bw'intama bwanjye n'imigwegwe yanjye byari bikwiriye kwambika umubiri we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ubu ngiye kugaragariza imbere y'abakunzi be ubushizi bw'isoni bwe, nta n'umwe uzamunkura mu maboko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzamumaraho ibyamunezezaga byose, ibirori bye n'iby'imboneko z'ukwezi bye n'amasabato ye, n'amateraniro ye yera yose yategetswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nzarimbura inzabibu ze n'imitini ye, ibyo yajyaga avuga ati ‘Ibi ni ingororano zanjye nahawe n'abakunzi banjye.’ Nuko ibyo ngiye kubihindura ishyamba, biribwe n'inyamaswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzamuhora iminsi yamaze yosereza ibigirwamana bya Bāli imibavu, yambaye impeta zo mu matwi n'inigi, agakurikira abakunzi be naho jye akanyibagirwa.” Ni ko Uwiteka avuga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Imana izongera gucyura Abisirayeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ni cyo gituma ngiye kumuhendahenda, mujyane mu kidaturwa mwurūre. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.7.24+JOS.7.25+JOS.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 7.24-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Avuyeyo nzamukomorera inzabibu ze, kandi igikombe cya Akori kizamubera irembo ry'ibyiringiro, kandi azaharirimbira nko mu gihe cy'ubukumi bwe, nko mu gihe yazamukaga ava mu gihugu cya Egiputa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka aravuga ati “Uwo munsi uzanyita Ishi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", kandi ntuzongera kunyita Bāli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzakura mu kanwa ke amazina y'ibigirwamana bya Bāli, kandi amazina yabyo ntazongera kwibukwa ukundi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Uwo munsi nzasezerana n'inyamaswa zo mu ishyamba ku bwabo, n'ibisiga byo mu kirere n'ibikururuka hasi, kandi nzavunagura imiheto n'inkota, n'intambara nzayikura mu gihugu, ntume baryamana amahoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nzakwishyingira ube uwanjye iteka ryose. Ni ukuri nzakwishyingira ube uwanjye nkiranuka ngaca imanza zitabera, nkagukunda kandi nkakubabarira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndetse nzakwishyingira ube uwanjye nkubereye umunyamurava, kandi uzamenya Uwiteka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka aravuga ati “Uwo munsi nzitaba, nzitaba ijuru, na ryo rizitaba isi. ",
